      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "An angry man comes looking for Kostya. Max opens the door and a case of mistaken identity leads to threats. Let's listen closely to their exchange in Russian first, and then walk through each line together.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Здравствуйте.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "nastya_father",
      "t": "Константин Анисимов?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Да, это я.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "А вы интернет чинить?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "nastya_father",
      "t": "Я отец Насти.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "nastya_father",
      "t": "Обидишь Настю, я из тебя колбасу сделаю.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Подождите.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Вы неправильно поняли.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Я не Костя.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Я Макс.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "А я интернет чинить.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Кто из вас Константин?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "nastya_father",
      "t": "Я.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go back through the exchange around Nastya's Father line by line and unpack how the Russian works.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Здравствуйте.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hello.' Opening the apartment door to a burly stranger, Max greets him politely.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nastya_father",
      "t": "Константин Анисимов?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Konstantin Anisimov?' Here, Nastya's father turns a statement into a question purely through rising intonation on the word meaning 'Konstantin', followed by 'Anisimov'.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Да, это я.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yes, that is me.' When the man asks for Konstantin Anisimov, Max carelessly says yes to sign for whatever it is.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "А вы интернет чинить?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Are you here to fix the internet?' Expecting a technician, Max asks if the man came to fix their internet.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nastya_father",
      "t": "Я отец Насти.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am Nastya's father.' The worst possible answer for Kostya's roommate.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nastya_father",
      "t": "Обидишь Настю, я из тебя колбасу сделаю.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If you hurt Nastya, I will turn you into sausage.' After revealing he is Nastya's father, the man threatens to turn 'Konstantin' into sausage if he ever hurts her.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Подождите.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Wait.' Terrified by the threat, Max tells the angry father to wait a second.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Вы неправильно поняли.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You understood incorrectly.' He scrambles to explain that there has been a huge misunderstanding.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Я не Костя.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am not Kostya.' Max blurts out that he is not actually Kostya.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Я Макс.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am Max.' He introduces himself by his real name, Max.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "А я интернет чинить.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And I am here to fix the internet.' Panicking further, Max even pretends he is only the internet repairman himself.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Кто из вас Константин?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Which one of you is Konstantin?' Looking around the room in confusion, Max asks who is supposed to be Konstantin.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nastya_father",
      "t": "Я.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Me.' Meanwhile, Nastya's father delivers a punchy one-word reaction built around the Russian word meaning 'I'. Now let's listen to the whole conversation again from start to finish.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
